#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:5
#: b1182599f216489dadef2ec426a4b9dc
msgid "Fly-By-Wire Low Altitude Limit"
msgstr "线控飞行低高度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:7
#: 6abfef5f7b3f481eb5c925cbd20a22fc
msgid ""
"This function of Plane allows you to set a minimum altitude for FBWB and "
"CRUISE modes (even if you don't have airspeed sensor) which your airplane "
"will try to stay above."
msgstr "Plane 的此功能允许为 FBWB 和 CRUISE 模式（即使没有空速传感器）设置最低高度，飞机将尽量保持在该高度以上。"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:11
#: a4422233f6ef4cd8ae151a48a4526223
msgid ""
"When :ref:`CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR<CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR>` is enabled, if your airplane "
"goes lower than defined altitude relative to HOME, it will level up and/or "
"climb back to this altitude. After it is reached you will regain altitude "
"control."
msgstr ""
"启用 :ref:`CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR<CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR>` 后，若飞机相对于 Home "
"点低于设定高度，将自动改平并爬升回该高度，达到后恢复高度控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:15
#: 13cbbe5b8948459c826c698b99b68d08
msgid ""
"the minimum MSL altitude target will be the higher of: this altitude, or the"
" current altitude target above terrain in FBWB or CRUISE modes if "
":ref:`common-terrain-following` is enabled, or the "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` above HOME if that fence (See "
":ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page`) is enabled."
msgstr ""
"最低 MSL 高度目标将取以下值中的较大者：该高度；若启用了 :ref:`common-terrain-following`，则为 FBWB 或 "
"CRUISE 模式中当前地形以上的高度目标；若启用了围栏（见 :ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page`），则为 "
"Home 点以上的 :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:18
#: 18d81852ac8b4cd989d2396a1faca1d6
msgid "Use for R/C training"
msgstr "用于遥控训练"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:20
#: e0bc485173034214b1ac6b397e6c9a2d
msgid ""
"This function will help those of us who doesn't have that much flying skills"
" to fly safely. It is really useful for FPV flying as FBWB or CRUISE modes "
"provide easy control and the :ref:`CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR<CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR>` limit"
" will help you avoid crashing into the ground ;-)"
msgstr ""
"此功能有助于飞行技术不够熟练的用户安全飞行。在 FPV 飞行中特别实用，FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式提供便捷控制，而 "
":ref:`CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR<CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR>` 限制将帮助您避免撞地 ;-)"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:25
#: 8cbfa0bc8ff74268bcbb61e70a36e19b
msgid ""
"`Here <http://youtu.be/9wysVRrOmcQ>`__ is a video demo. APM is in FBW-B mode"
" and I hold pitch all the way DOWN! until the very end of video. Minimum alt"
" was set 30 meters above home altitude, so you can see ground."
msgstr ""
"`这里 <http://youtu.be/9wysVRrOmcQ>`__ 有一段演示视频。APM 处于 FBW-B "
"模式，我将俯仰一直向下压到视频最后。最低高度设为 Home 点以上 30 米，因此可以看到地面。"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:31
#: 9c32a65114774fa38a444042a1c9c030
msgid "How to setup Alt Limit"
msgstr "如何设置高度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:33
#: 429fc91f6ec440e39a136625a7ac65cb
msgid ""
"Using your APM Mission Planner you will have to set parameter "
":ref:`CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR<CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR>` to the desired alt **in meters!** "
"If it is **0** then it is turned off."
msgstr ""
"使用 APM Mission Planner 将参数 :ref:`CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR<CRUISE_ALT_FLOOR>` "
"设置为期望高度，单位为 **米！** 若为 **0** 则关闭此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:38
#: 6e3783ee200f477f9887074a53b146de
msgid "Choosing the right altitude"
msgstr "选择合适的高度"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:40
#: 4db544aec4c04425a6871c038515fa32
msgid ""
"Desired altitude should be set very carefully. As we know our planes can't "
"react immediately, so we have to choose altitude with this in mind. Using "
"3000 (30 meters) is recommended for flights over pretty flat terrain."
msgstr "期望高度需谨慎设置。由于飞机无法立即响应，设置时需考虑这一因素。对于较平坦地形的飞行，建议使用 3000（30 米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:45
#: f75bf31c40b942c5a9631ea527bfcec1
msgid "Landing"
msgstr "降落"

#: ../../source/docs/fly-by-wire-low-altitude-limit.rst:47
#: dc9f4b940da34ca0816e4e82a0807e53
msgid ""
"In order to land your plane you will need to disable this feature by "
"changing your flightmode to anything other than FBWB or CRUISE. FBWA, "
"STABILIZE, or MANUAL modes are always the preferred modes for a manual "
"landing, in any case."
msgstr ""
"降落时需要将飞行模式切换为 FBWB 或 CRUISE 以外的模式来禁用此功能。无论如何，手动降落时首选 FBWA、Stabilize 或 MANUAL"
" 模式。"
